_FR:"L'adiClub est le programme de fid\xe9lit\xe9 adidas o\xf9 tu gagnes des points adiClub pour passer au niveau sup\xe9rieur et o\xf9 tu les utilises pour recevoir des r\xe9compenses, comme des produits exclusifs, des exp\xe9riences, des offres sp\xe9ciales pour les membres et plus encore. Et c'est gratuit.",en_FI:"Join the adidas adiClub, a loyalty program where members can earn points to level up and unlock exclusive rewards, special offers, events and more.",es_ES:"adiClub es el programa de fidelizaci\xf3n de adidas que te permite ganar puntos adiClub para canjearlos por recompensas como productos exclusivos, experiencias, ofertas especiales y mucho m\xe1s conforme subas de nivel. Suscribirse es gratis.",da_DK:"",en_DE:"Join the adidas adiClub, a loyalty program where members can earn points to level up and unlock exclusive rewards, special offers, events and more.",de_DE:"",cs_CZ:"",en_US:"Join adiClub, the adidas loyalty program where members get more. Sign up to unlock exclusive products, early access to sales, events and special rewards.",vi_VN:"Gia nhập adiClub để mở kh\xf3a phần thưởng, trải nghiệm v\xe0 giảm gi\xe1 độc quyền chỉ d\xe0nh cho hội vi\xean. Bắt đầu ngay h\xf4m nay!",en_VN:"adiClub is the membership program that unlocks the best of adidas. Join the adiClub community today, start earning points and get rewarded.",tr_TR:"adiClub, seni adidas'ın en iyilerine ulaştıran bir \xfcyelik programı. Puan kazan, seviye atla ve yol boyunca yepyeni \xf6d\xfcller kazan.",en_TR:"With adiClub membership, you can closely follow the innovations offered by Adidas. Explore how to access products and privileges exclusive to members.",en_SG:"adiClub is the membership program that unlocks the best of adidas. Join the adiClub community today, start earning points and get rewarded.",en_PH:"adiClub is the membership program that unlocks the best of adidas. Join the adiClub community today, start earning points and get rewarded.",en_MY:"adiClub is the membership program